# Cloudflare Pages header rules. Copied into build/ by the Makefile.

# Static assets aren't content-hashed, so no `immutable` — a day of caching
# with a week of background revalidation keeps them updatable.
/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
